OL,3,GNEWSAPlans for 10-year nuclear weapons
OL,4,Afactory rebuild
OL,5,
OL,6,FA plan to rebuild parts of a nuclear
OL,7,Fweapons factory over 10 years is set to
OL,8,Fbe submitted to a local planning
OL,9,Fauthority within months.
OL,11,FThe Atomic Weapons Establishment (AWE)
OL,12,Fin Aldermaston, Berkshire, will seek to
OL,13,Freplace ageing facilities with what it
OL,14,Fis calling its Future Materials Campus.
OL,16,FAn outline planning application is
OL,17,Fexpected to be submitted to West
OL,18,FBerkshire Council this winter as part
OL,19,Fof a broader #15bn government
OL,20,Finvestment into the UK's nuclear
OL,21,Fwarhead programme.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,332,330,200,160,0,100
