OL,3,GNEWSAPlans for 10-year nuclear weapons
OL,4,Afactory rebuild
OL,5,
OL,6,FAWE said it will begin preparing the
OL,7,Fsite after the outline planning
OL,8,Fapplication is approved, with main
OL,9,Fconstruction work expected to start
OL,10,Fwithin two to three years.
